  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Its becoming more common to have guilds or groups of people who frequent custom maps as thier \"headquarters\", the current method of having a \"guild only\" map is to upload it as private and create a friends+ link in the discord of that group/guild. I was hoping there might be a more official way to do that in game? With a map closed off to people except guild members, outsiders can request to join but guild members can come and leave freely. Itd be nice to wander a map knowing the players there are members or something.\nIm just throwing the idea out there, I have no idea how it'd be possible for vrchat to tell who is in a guild or not. but member only [friends invite] maps for guild HQ's would be interesting.",
